{"kode":"CCSI","sumber":"Stockbit profile","dipanen_pada":"2026-08-23","address":[{"id":"1000002268","email":["corsec@ccsi.co.id"],"fax":"021-29865984","npwp":"01.071.235.4-055.000","phone":"021-29865963","website":"www.ccsi.co.id","key":"","lastupdate":"2022-03-09T14:40:00+07:00","value":"<td colspan='4'>Grand Slipi Tower lantai 45 Jalan Letjen S. Parman Kav 22-24 RT.001/ RW.004, Kel Palmerah, Kec. Palmerah, Kota Administrasi Jakarta Barat\n\n        \t\t  \t\t\tPhone: 021-29865963\n        \t\t  \t\t\tFax: 021-29865984\n                            NPWP: 01.071.235.4-055.000\n        \t\t  \t\t\tEmail: corsec@ccsi.co.id\n        \t\t  \t\t\tWebsite: www.ccsi.co.id\n\n        \t  \t\t\t</td>","office":"Grand Slipi Tower lantai 45 Jalan Letjen S. Parman Kav 22-24 RT.001/ RW.004, Kel Palmerah, Kec. Palmerah, Kota Administrasi Jakarta Barat"}],"background":"PT Communication Cable Systems Indonesia Tbk. (CCSI) adalah pemimpin dalam industri produsen kabel serat optik di Indonesia. CCSI dikenal sebagai produsen kabel serat optik premium berkualitas tinggi. CCSI memiliki kemampuan untuk memproduksi berbagai kabel serat optik dalam dan luar ruangan (indoor dan outdoor). Saat ini CCSI adalah satu-satunya produsen kabel serat optik di Indonesia yang mampu memproduksi kabel bawah laut. Setiap kabel dirancang untuk berbagai penggunaan dan kondisi. Serat optik dijamin bebas tarikan dan tanpa efek regangan selama produksi, penyimpanan, dan pemasangan. Ini untuk memastikan masa pakai kabel yang panjang dan kapasitas membawa data yang optimal. Pabrik CCSI memiliki kapasitas produksi 1.600.000 km serat optik pertahun. Pabrik tersebut berlokasi di Kawasan Industri Krakatau di Cilegon, Banten; sedangkan, Kantor Penjualan & Pemasaran berlokasi di Jakarta. Selain kabel serat optik, CCSI juga menawarkan berbagai aksesori kabel optik yang lengkap (tip-to-tip). Kami juga memproduksi HDPE subducts dan Microducts. Sebagai bagian dari strategi diversifikasi, mulai tahun 2014, perusahaan juga memproduksi pipa HDPE dan Reinforced Thermoplastic Pipes (RTP) untuk industri minyak & gas.","history":{"amount":"50 B","board":"Papan Pengembangan","date":"18 Jun 2019","price":"250","registrar":"","shares":"200,000,000","underwriters":["PT. UOB Kay Hian Sekuritas","PT. Valbury Sekuritas","PT. KGI Sekuritas","PT. NISP Sekuritas"],"administrative_bureau":"PT Adimitra Jasa Korpora","free_float":"9.09%"},"key_executive":{"commissioner":[{"id":"13835176","key":"Commissioner","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:37:11+07:00","value":"Sudarno Khou"}],"director":[{"id":"13835169","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:37:11+07:00","value":"Anang Pratikno"},{"id":"13835170","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:37:11+07:00","value":"Ren Yi Newton Djatmiko"},{"id":"13835171","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:37:11+07:00","value":"Harris Kristanto Gozali"},{"id":"13835172","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:37:11+07:00","value":"Teuku Zulfikar"},{"id":"13835173","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:37:11+07:00","value":"Irawan Mario Noh Palilingan"},{"id":"13835175","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:37:11+07:00","value":"Erwin Richard Andersen"}],"independent_commissioner":[{"id":"13835177","key":"Commissioner (Independent)","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:37:11+07:00","value":"Bambang Adi Prastyo"}],"president_commissioner":[{"id":"13835178","key":"President Commissioner","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:37:11+07:00","value":"Chai Khye Yeien"}],"president_director":[{"id":"13835168","key":"President Director","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:37:11+07:00","value":"Peter Djatmiko"}],"vice_president":[{"id":"13835174","key":"Vice President Director","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:37:11+07:00","value":"Sukarnen"}],"vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_president_commissioner":[]},"secretary":[{"id":"12538266","key":"","lastupdate":"2022-03-09T14:40:00+07:00","value":"{\"name\":\"IRAWAN MARIO NOH PAL